# Distribution guards for Paper Figure Story.
#
# 1. Internal audit material must never reach an archive export. The two
#    directories below are removed from the 1.1.1-rc.1 candidate; the rules
#    stay here so a future working branch cannot silently reintroduce them.
# 2. Generated papers, deliverables and archives are local working output.
#    Only the two shipped demo decks are whitelisted in .gitignore.
#
# git has no "export only these paths" rule, so the authoritative distribution
# list is the release whitelist generated with the package
# (dist/RC_FILE_MANIFEST.txt, 140 paths + SHA256). export-ignore below is the
# second line of defence, not the whitelist itself.

_g1_validation/** export-ignore
G1_REVIEW/** export-ignore

*.pdf export-ignore
*.docx export-ignore
*.zip export-ignore
output/** export-ignore
outputs/** export-ignore
_cache/** export-ignore
cache/** export-ignore
__pycache__/** export-ignore
*.py[cod] export-ignore
.venv/** export-ignore
venv/** export-ignore
.env export-ignore
.env.* export-ignore
.idea/** export-ignore
.vscode/** export-ignore
.DS_Store export-ignore
Thumbs.db export-ignore
